{"4831290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crown&Sword", "steam_appid": 4831290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your kingdom is in danger. Equip your crown and sword, assemble your army, and fight against the relentless darkness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crown &amp; Sword</strong> is an epic 2D tactical Action RPG that combines base management, army building, and wave survival elements. You must manage your time in a dynamic day/night cycle, fortify your kingdom, and fight shoulder to shoulder against the relentless swarms that awaken when the sun sets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >☀️ DAYTIME: Preparation and Kingdom Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your resources wisely before the sun goes down. Hoard your gold to upgrade your kingdom's buildings (Blacksmith, Barracks, Healing structures) and gather your army. Train Warriors, Lancers, and Archers that fit your strategy to create your tactical formation. You must perfect your preparations to survive when night falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831290/extras/c6f98ab7741d1abbb2fa123c270d75fe.poster.avif?t=1786944879\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831290/extras/c6f98ab7741d1abbb2fa123c270d75fe.webm?t=1786944879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831290/extras/c6f98ab7741d1abbb2fa123c270d75fe.mp4?t=1786944879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌙 NIGHTTIME: Relentless Swarms and Autonomous Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the clock strikes 22:00, the sky darkens and the emissaries of the night awaken. The army you brought from the barracks doesn't just wait behind you; thanks to their advanced tactical AI, they spread across the map, seek out enemies on their own, and automatically engage the swarms in combat. When the battle is over, they collect the gold and loot on the ground for you, adding it to your kingdom's treasury!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831290/extras/1eb648ee2953aeafaa1522e52a1d3e17.poster.avif?t=1786944879\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831290/extras/1eb648ee2953aeafaa1522e52a1d3e17.webm?t=1786944879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831290/extras/1eb648ee2953aeafaa1522e52a1d3e17.mp4?t=1786944879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Epic Boss Fights and Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for chaotic clashes with damage numbers flying through the air. The waves of enemies grow stronger every night. From skeleton armies to giant Trolls, Minotaurs, and deadly Werewolves, many different threats will breach your borders. Defeat bosses, collect rare items, and make your army even deadlier for the next night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗺️ Kingdom Map &amp; Progression System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True power comes from expanding your borders! Grow your realm by beating challenging levels on a dedicated tactical Kingdom Map. Conquering these levels and progressing through the map is the only way to permanently upgrade your main base, construct new buildings, and unlock deadlier military units. You must emerge victorious in these campaigns to turn your small kingdom into a mighty empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831290/extras/2e0d789f09b7649a14b2da4eef56b4cd.poster.avif?t=1786944879\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831290/extras/2e0d789f09b7649a14b2da4eef56b4cd.webm?t=1786944879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831290/extras/2e0d789f09b7649a14b2da4eef56b4cd.mp4?t=1786944879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📜 KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Auto-Battler:</strong> Build your army, set your formation, and watch your soldiers fight on their own and collect loot from the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Day/Night Cycle:</strong> Focus on base management and preparation during the day, and fight a relentless battle for survival at night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Management and Expansion:</strong> Use your gold to level up your buildings and unlock much more powerful military units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swarm Mechanics and Bosses:</strong> Push your limits against increasingly difficult enemy swarms and epic Boss fights that require tactical positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Combat UI:</strong> Feel the chaos of war with flying damage numbers, critical hits, and a satisfying combat feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831290/extras/9cbe1aa17ff55f8b93ebf91466ead110.avif?t=1786944879\" width=822 height=614 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your kingdom is in danger. Equip your crown and sword, assemble your army, and fight against the relentless darkness!</p><p c