ed.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831290/extras/2e0d789f09b7649a14b2da4eef56b4cd.mp4?t=1786944879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📜 KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Auto-Battler:</strong> Build your army, set your formation, and watch your soldiers fight on their own and collect loot from the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Day/Night Cycle:</strong> Focus on base management and preparation during the day, and fight a relentless battle for survival at night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Management and Expansion:</strong> Use your gold to level up your buildings and unlock much more powerful military units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swarm Mechanics and Bosses:</strong> Push your limits against increasingly difficult enemy swarms and epic Boss fights that require tactical positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Combat UI:</strong> Feel the chaos of war with flying damage numbers, critical hits, and a satisfying combat feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831290/extras/9cbe1aa17ff55f8b93ebf91466ead110.avif?t=1786944879\" width=822 height=614 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Crown &amp; Sword is an epic 2D tactical Action RPG that combines base management, army building, and wave survival elements. You must manage your time in a dynamic day/night cycle, fortify your kingdom, and fight shoulder to shoulder against the relentless swarms that awaken when the sun sets.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Russian, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c